an yang produktif, kritis, dan bermanfaat\" (the use of technology needs guidance so that it does not stop at content creation activities, but develops into productive, critical, and beneficial abilities). This directly links digital literacy with productive utilization.", "verdict": 1}, {"statement": "Pemanfaatan produktif berarti menggunakan teknologi tidak hanya untuk hiburan.", "reason": "The context states that the use of technology should \"tidak berhenti pada aktivitas membuat konten, tetapi berkembang menjadi kemampuan yang produktif, kritis, dan bermanfaat\" (not stop at content creation activities, but develop into productive, critical, and beneficial abilities). This implies moving beyond mere entertainment.", "verdict": 1}, {"statement": "Pemanfaatan produktif berarti menggunakan teknologi untuk pengembangan keterampilan kritis.", "reason": "The context states that the use of technology should \"berkembang menjadi kemampuan yang produktif, kritis, dan bermanfaat\" (develop into productive, critical, and beneficial abilities). This directly supports the development of critical skills.", "verdict": 1}, {"statement": "Pemanfaatan produktif berarti menggunakan teknologi untuk pengembangan keterampilan bermanfaat.", "reason": "The context states that the use of technology should \"berkembang menjadi kemampuan yang produktif, kritis, dan bermanfaat\" (develop into productive, critical, and beneficial abilities). This directly supports the development of beneficial skills.", "verdict": 1}, {"statement": "Beritajateng.tv menyediakan informasi ini pada 21 Agustus 2026.", "reason": "The context does not mention Beritajateng.tv as the provider of this information, nor does it provide any date for the information presented.", "verdict": 0}, {"statement": "Literasi digital penting diajarkan kepada remaja.", "reason": "The entire context discusses the importance of digital literacy for teenagers, highlighting risks and protective factors in the digital era, and how parents like Ayu are teaching it to their children.", "verdict": 1}, {"statement": "Literasi digital diajarkan kepada remaja agar remaja menjadi pengguna aktif yang bijak.", "reason": "Ayu states that self-regulation is important \"agar anak tidak sekadar menjadi pengguna pasif, tetapi juga mampu menilai dengan kritis siapa yang ia ikuti dan dengan siapa ia berinteraksi\" (so that children do not just become passive users, but are also able to critically assess who they follow and with whom they interact). This implies becoming a wise and active user.", "verdict": 1}, {"statement": "Literasi digital diajarkan kepada remaja agar remaja tidak menjadi konsumen pasif yang rentan terhadap risiko dunia maya.", "reason": "Ayu states that self-regulation is important \"agar anak tidak sekadar menjadi pengguna pasif, tetapi juga mampu menilai dengan kritis siapa yang ia ikuti dan dengan siapa ia berinteraksi\" (so that children do not just become passive users, but are also able to critically assess who they follow and with whom they interact). This directly implies avoiding being a passive consumer vulnerable to online risks.", "verdict": 1}]}. Got: 1 validation error for StringIO
